  "body": "<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:30px 0 22px\"><b>ÇANKAYA BELEDİYE BAŞKANLIĞINA</b></p><p style=\"text-align:right\"><span data-v=\"genel.tarih\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Bugünün tarihi</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-indent:12mm;line-height:1.6\">Maliki bulunduğum <span data-v=\"proje.mahalle\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Mahalle</span>, <span data-v=\"proje.ada\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Ada no</span> ada <span data-v=\"proje.parsel\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Parsel no</span> parselde inşa edilecek “<span data-v=\"proje.adi\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Proje adı</span>” yapısına ait projelerin incelenerek onaylanması ve gerekli işlemlerin yapılması hususunda gereğini arz ederim.</p><p><b>Arsa sahibi:</b> <span data-v=\"arsaSahibi.ad\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Arsa sahibi · Ad Soyad</span> (TC <span data-v=\"arsaSahibi.tc\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Arsa sahibi · TC No</span>)<br><b>Adres:</b> <span data-v=\"arsaSahibi.adres\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Arsa sahibi · Adres</span></p><p style=\"margin:18px 0 6px\"><b>Proje müelliflerinin iletişim bilgileri</b></p><div data-repeat=\"muellifler\" style=\"outline:1.5px dashed #8a96e0;outline-offset:3px;margin:8px 0\"><p style=\"margin:3px 0\"><span data-v=\"muellifler[].sira\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Müellifler · Sıra</span>. <span data-v=\"muellifler[].adSoyad\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Müellifler · Ad Soyad</span> (<span data-v=\"muellifler[].meslek\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Müellifler · Meslek</span>) — <span data-v=\"muellifler[].telefon\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Müellifler · Telefon</span></p></div><table data-sig=\"1\" style=\"margin:30px 0 0 auto;border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width:62mm;height:15mm;border-bottom:1px solid #222\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;padding-top:5px\">Arsa sahibi vekili<br><span data-v=\"vekil.ad\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"background:#e9eefb;color:#2a3180;border:1px solid #c3cdf0;border-radius:4px;padding:0 4px;font-size:.9em;font-weight:600;box-decoration-break:clone;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',system-ui,sans-serif\">Vekil · Ad Soyad</span><br>İmza</td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>",
